// LAYER 3 — DESKTOP PLUGIN (the face) · Kuya Hermes HQ
//
// HQ control surface for Suki Mart branch operations inside Hermes Desktop.
//   * Full "Kuya Hermes HQ" page (sidebar nav): mascot header, Run-full-sweep
//     card, live KPI tiles, 12 branch cards with live risk badges, per-branch
//     actions, an Ask box and a live branch pulse panel.
//   * Compact right-side pane next to the chat, plus Ctrl/Cmd+K commands.
//
// Loop: button → prompt naming the kuya-hermes-ops skill → skill chains the
// suki MCP tools → the plugin listens for those tools' `tool.complete` events
// on the gateway stream and renders the REAL results here. The same skill +
// MCP answer branch managers on Telegram.
//
// Install (folder name MUST equal the id below):
//   Windows:     %LOCALAPPDATA%\hermes\desktop-plugins\kuya-hermes-hq\plugin.js
//   macOS/Linux: ~/.hermes/desktop-plugins/kuya-hermes-hq/plugin.js
// Then Ctrl/Cmd+K → "Reload desktop plugins".
//
// Loader rules: only '@hermes/plugin-sdk', 'react', 'react/jsx-runtime' resolve;
// no JSX syntax; theme variables only (color-mix over theme vars is fine).

